34:["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Riyadh to the Al Batha border."}]," The long Saudi leg heads south-east across open desert. Service stations are spaced out, so plan fuel, food and prayer stops rather than improvising."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The border."}]," You exit Saudi Arabia at Al Batha and enter the UAE at Ghuwaifat. Both sets of checks are done in person, so every passenger gets out and carries their documents."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The E11 to Abu Dhabi."}]," Once in the UAE the road follows the coast east through the Al Dhafra region towards the capital."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Arrival."}]," Drop-offs are usually a hotel, home, office or Zayed International Airport (AUH)."]}],"\n"]}]
35:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["If your destination is Dubai instead, the same road continues roughly another 140 km. See ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/blog/riyadh-to-dubai-taxi-gcc-road-trip","children":"Riyadh to Dubai by road"}]," for that version."]}]
36:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"which-border-crossing-is-used","children":"Which border crossing is used?"}]
37:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["Traffic between Riyadh and Abu Dhabi uses ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Al Batha on the Saudi side and Ghuwaifat on the UAE side"}],", at the western end of the E11 highway. It is a land crossing, so unlike a flight there is no airline check-in: you queue with the vehicle, and each passenger is checked at the counters."]}]
38:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"what-documents-do-you-need","children":"What documents do you need?"}]
39:["$","p","p-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Documents are your responsibility, and the rules depend on nationality and residency."}]," In general each passenger needs:"]}]
3a:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"a valid passport or accepted ID;"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"the right to enter the UAE for their nationality;"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"for Saudi residents, a valid exit and re-entry permission."}],"\n"]}]
3b:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["Rules change, so check the official sources before you travel — for the UAE, the Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs & Port Security (",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://icp.gov.ae","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"icp.gov.ae"}],"); for Saudi exit and re-entry status, the Absher platform (",["$","a","a-1",{"href":"https://www.absher.sa","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"absher.sa"}],"). A driver can support you through the crossing, but cannot obtain visas or entry permissions on your behalf."]}]
3c:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"Tell us every passenger's nationality when you book, so anything that might affect the crossing is flagged before the day."}]
3d:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"drive-or-fly-from-riyadh-to-abu-dhabi","children":"Drive or fly from Riyadh to Abu Dhabi?"}]
3e:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"There is a short flight between the two capitals, and for one traveller with light luggage it is the faster option. Driving makes sense in other situations:"}]
3f:["$","div","table-1",{"className":"blog-table not-prose","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Situation"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"Better choice"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"One traveller, carry-on only, fixed meeting time"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Flying"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"A family or group sharing one vehicle"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Driving"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Heavy luggage, samples, equipment or a relocation"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Driving"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"You want door to door with no airport at either end"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Driving"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Stops on the way (for example the Eastern Province)"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Driving"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-5",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"A tight schedule where a border queue would be a risk"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Flying"}]]}]]}]]}]}]
40:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"The honest trade-off: driving swaps airport time for border time, and the border is the less predictable of the two. If an exact arrival hour matters more than comfort and luggage, fly."}]
41:["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"how-to-make-the-day-easier","children":"How to make the day easier"}]
42:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Leave early."}]," A morning start puts the crossing in daylight and the arrival in the evening."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Keep passports in hand luggage"}],", not in the boot."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Plan one or two proper stops"}]," — a long desert road is not the place to push on without a break."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Avoid a tight commitment on arrival."}]," Do not book a dinner or meeting for an hour after your estimated arrival."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Share your Abu Dhabi address precisely"}]," — hotel name and area, or a pin for a private address."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Download offline maps"}],"; mobile coverage can drop on long stretches."]}],"\n"]}]
43:["$","h2","h2-6",{"id":"choosing-a-vehicle-for-an-8-hour-drive","children":"Choosing a vehicle for an 8-hour drive"}]
44:["$","p","p-10",{"children":["Comfort and luggage space matter more than on a city trip. Families and groups usually take a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"full-size SUV"}]," (GMC Yukon XL class, up to 7 passengers) or a ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"van"}],"; executives travelling alone or in pairs often prefer an ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"executive sedan"}]," so they can work in the back. Compare the categories on our ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/fleet","children":"vehicle classes page"}],"."]}]
45:["$","h2","h2-7",{"id":"how-the-fare-works","children":"How the fare works"}]
46:["$","p","p-11",{"children":["The fare is one fixed price for the trip you describe, agreed before you book — no meter and no surge. Vehicle border crossing fees are included in the fare; personal visa or entry fees are your own. Pay ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"cash to the driver or by bank transfer"}],", an ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"electronic receipt"}]," is available on request, and companies can request an invoice. ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"Free cancellation up to 24 hours before pickup."}]]}]
47:["$","p","p-12",{"children":["This is a pre-booked private car from your Riyadh address to your Abu Dhabi address, not a local Abu Dhabi taxi service. To book, see the ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/routes/riyadh-to-abudhabi","children":"Riyadh to Abu Dhabi private car page"}],"."]}]
48:["$","h2","h2-8",{"id":"common-questions","children":"Common questions"}]
49:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"how-long-does-it-take-to-drive-from-riyadh-to-abu-dhabi","children":"How long does it take to drive from Riyadh to Abu Dhabi?"}]
4a:["$","p","p-13",{"children":"About 8 hours of driving for roughly 850 km, plus border time. Plan for a full day."}]
4b:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"which-border-do-you-use-from-riyadh-to-abu-dhabi","children":"Which border do you use from Riyadh to Abu Dhabi?"}]
4c:["$","p","p-14",{"children":"Al Batha on the Saudi side and Ghuwaifat on the UAE side, joining the E11 highway on the UAE side."}]
4d:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"is-abu-dhabi-closer-than-dubai-from-riyadh","children":"Is Abu Dhabi closer than Dubai from Riyadh?"}]
4e:["$","p","p-15",{"children":"Yes. The road to Abu Dhabi is about 140 km shorter than the road to Dubai."}]
4f:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"do-i-need-a-visa-to-enter-the-uae-by-road","children":"Do I need a visa to enter the UAE by road?"}]
50:["$","p","p-16",{"children":"That depends on your nationality and residency. Check the official UAE requirements before you travel; you carry your own valid documents."}]
51:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"can-i-make-the-trip-in-the-other-direction","children":"Can I make the trip in the other direction?"}]
52:["$","p","p-17",{"children":["Yes — see ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/routes/abudhabi-to-riyadh","children":"Abu Dhabi to Riyadh"}],"."]}]
53:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"can-i-stop-in-the-eastern-province-on-the-way","children":"Can I stop in the Eastern Province on the way?"}]
54:["$","p","p-18",{"children":"Yes. Tell us when you book and the stop is planned into the quote."}]
